cites: Microsoft Learn [S1, S2, S4, S4b,
S7b, S8, S10, S10c, S11b, S12, S12b,

306
00:21:07.378 --> 00:21:17.069
S13–S15, S14b]; Oracle [S18, S21–S23];
AWS [S25, S27–S30, S32, S33];

307
00:21:17.069 --> 00:21:30.510
Broadcom [S36]; Infoblox [S37]; Book 03
